--Description:  Calculate the centred-moving-average ratio for each product & month in 2017,
--              then return only those products whose ratio never slips to 2 or below during
--              the year.  The PRODUCTS table uses lower-case quoted columns ("id", "name"),
--              so reference them exactly that way to avoid identifier errors.
WITH ratios AS (
