/* 1) Compute the centred moving-average (CMA) with the two 12-month
      overlapping windows, then the Sales-to-CMA ratio for every
      product / month.

   2) Keep the 2017 rows only.

   3) Pick those products whose ratio is above 2 for all 12 months
